WwW-SiteConf-Redo

The `redo' generator of siteconf: `siteconf -g -G redo' writes a .do
file for each target and goal, for redo.  See
RdKw::WwW::SiteConf::Backend::Redo.

It is released with WwW-SiteConf, at the same version, and needs
that version.

    perl Makefile.PL && make && make test && make install
